flowchart TD
  S[Read desired generation and digest] --> O[Observe actual]
  O --> F[Pure diff]
  F -->|stale precondition| R[Abort and replan]
  F -->|no action| V[Verify observation]
  F -->|future action| A[Act at safe boundary]
  A --> V
  V -->|matches desired| P[Publish derived status]
  V -->|mismatch| R
  P --> Z[Restartable; recompute after crash]

